@page "/artists"

<PageTitle>Play house concerts - GigHaus</PageTitle>
<HeadContent>
    <meta name="description" content="House concerts put artists in front of people who came to listen. GigHaus is free for artists." />
</HeadContent>

<section class="mk-page-head">
    <div class="mk-wrap mk-page-head__grid">
        <div>
            <p class="mk-kicker">For artists</p>
            <h1>Play to a room that came to listen.</h1>
            <p class="mk-lead">
                No bar noise and no fighting the blender. A house concert is thirty people in a room,
                there for the songs and glad to meet you afterward.
            </p>
            <a class="mk-btn" href="contact">Get in touch</a>
        </div>
        <Mascot Size="320" />
    </div>
</section>

<section class="mk-section">
    <div class="mk-wrap">
        <h2>How artists fit in.</h2>
        <div class="mk-cards mk-cards--three">
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>Hosts bring you in</h3>
                <p>You and a host agree on a date, and the host adds the show to GigHaus with your name on it.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card mk-card--gold">
                <h3>Guests support you</h3>
                <p>Guests contribute at the door. GigHaus takes nothing, so what they give goes to supporting you.</p>
            </article>
            <article class="mk-card">
                <h3>It costs you nothing</h3>
                <p>There's no fee to appear on GigHaus. Know a great room? Point your favorite host our way.</p>
            </article>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>
